Vendored source: third_party/
-----------------------------

libsmb2 — SMB2/3 client
  Vendored:  third_party/libsmb2/{lib,include}
  Licence:   LGPL-2.1-or-later
  Texts:     third_party/libsmb2/LICENCE-LGPL-2.1.txt, third_party/libsmb2/COPYING
  Upstream:  https://github.com/sahlberg/libsmb2
  MODIFIED:  locally patched. The vendored copy carries a fix for a
             use-after-free in opendir()'s error path (upstream's
             dir->free_cb_data ownership flag plus a cross-file
             smb2_dir_take_cb_data() helper, declared in
             include/libsmb2-private.h). The library's own sources and licence
             are otherwise unchanged.
  Note:      upstream splits this repository by licence; only the LGPL-2.1+
             library directories are vendored. The BSD-licensed examples/ tree
             is NOT included.

