Licence compatibility
---------------------
The whole is GPL-3.0-or-later. The vendored libraries are LGPL-2.1-or-later,
which the LGPL permits to be combined with GPL-3.0 code (LGPL-2.1 section 3
allows relicensing to GPL-2.0-or-later, and GPL-3.0 is permitted by this
project's own "or later" option). The BSD-licensed rpcgen-derived libnfs files
are permissive and impose no additional condition beyond attribution.

The Zlib-licensed zlib and minizip-ng, and the public-domain LZMA SDK decoder,
are permissive / public domain and impose no condition beyond attribution.
UnRAR is conveyed as a separate, non-free-but-redistributable component under
its own terms (its licence notice is included above and in its source); it is
not relicensed to GPL, which is permitted because it is merely redistributed
alongside this project, not combined into the GPL work.

